  "details": "When aiming the cursor to place a sticker, the placement position appears to be based on world colliders. However, once you actually place the sticker, the sticker is applied based on rendered depth. This results in unexpected placement when the sticker lands on a mesh that has ZWrite on but no collider. It would be better if the preview reflected where the sticker will actually be placed in the end.",
